<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000543> rdfs:label "Optic disc pallor"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A pale yellow discoloration of the optic disc (the area of the optic nerve head in the retina). The optic disc normally has a pinkish hue with a central yellowish depression." ;
