<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000716> rdfs:label "Depression" ;
    dcterms:description "Frequently experiencing feelings of being down, miserable, and/or hopeless; struggling to recover from these moods; having a pessimistic outlook on the future; feeling a pervasive sense of shame; having a low self-worth; experiencing thoughts of suicide and engaging in suicidal behavior." ;
