<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000964> rdfs:label "Eczematoid dermatitis" ;
    dcterms:description "Eczema is a form of dermatitis that is characterized by scaly, pruritic, erythematous lesions located on flexural surfaces." ;
