<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001156> rdfs:label "Brachydactyly" ;
    dcterms:description "Digits that appear disproportionately short compared to the hand/foot. The word brachydactyly is used here to describe a series distinct patterns of shortened digits (brachydactyly types A-E). This is the sense used here." ;
