<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0009830> rdfs:label "Peripheral neuropathy" ;
    dcterms:description "Peripheral neuropathy is a general term for any disorder of the peripheral nervous system. The main clinical features used to classify peripheral neuropathy are distribution, type (mainly demyelinating versus mainly axonal), duration, and course." ;
