<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0012450> rdfs:label "Chronic constipation" ;
    dcterms:description "Constipation for longer than three months with fewer than 3 bowel movements per week, straining, lumpy or hard stools, and a sensation of anorectal obstruction or incomplete defecation." ;
